00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.130
He's small now!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.840
I admit defeat.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.050
You did it! Nozomu-kun, that was incredible!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.680
I couldn't have done it without you both.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.230
Nice Aikatsu!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:55.980
And thus, Yume and Nozomu successfully overthrew the Demon Lord.

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.620
What did you want to show me?

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.120
It's more fun if it's a surprise.

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:22.760
See? Isn't it lovely?

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.560
Surprise!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.060
Yume, I've been waiting for you.

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.070
Why?

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.860
Today we celebrate.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:38.280
Right, Prince?

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.280
Prince?!

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:43.120
Yume-chan, I've kept it a secret, but in truth...

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.370
I am the Prince of the Kingdom of M4.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:49.330
You are? I had no idea.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:53.670
As we traveled side by side, I fell for your single-minded determination.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:54.790
Does that mean...

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:58.420
Will you marry me?

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.430
Yes!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:13.690
Let's spend the day celebrating to our hearts' content.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.690
But if we make too much noise, the human will hear us.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.360
She's here!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:24.200
There's no need to worry. She's my friend.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:29.200
I brought Yuzu's special donut and pudding. Eat up!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:33.620
And so, the story reached a happy ending.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:39.130
And they all lived happily ever after.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.520
Was that really worth crying for?

00:20:56.520 --> 00:21:01.940
It's just that I'm so relieved the movie turned out well 
after all we went through to make it!

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:02.780
Yume-chan.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:04.950
Nozomu-kun.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.360
Good work.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:10.240
Your support was what kept me going until the very end.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.040
Thank you for everything!

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.210
Same here. I hope we get the chance again.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.120
Me too.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:19.880
It's Hime-senpai!

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.590
I'm going to say hello.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:24.130
It was nice working with you!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.180
Subaru-kun, is that a hint of jealousy I detect?

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:30.720
Huh? Don't be stupid, we were just playing the roles.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:35.270
That's good then. I wouldn't want to have to fight against a strong rival like you.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:36.140
What?

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.650
By the way, Kanata-kun.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.520
Did the lottery not give you a part at all?

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.650
No, I was in the movie.

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:46.950
You played three roles yourself?! That's awesome!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.570
Only I could pull it off.

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:54.160
Yume-chan, you played the main role marvelously.

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:56.540
It turned out to be a wonderful production.

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:58.170
Thank you!

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:01.090
I greatly enjoyed your Koharuderella as well.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:02.880
Your acting was very realistic.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:04.170
I'm so glad!

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:07.130
Rola Riding Hood was a ton of fun too!

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:08.430
I'm honored!

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:12.430
In order to act alongside you all again one day,

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:14.520
I'm going to Aikatsu as hard as I can!

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:15.680
Me too!

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:18.440
I'm expecting great things.

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:19.560
Right!

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:03.460
My Little Heart's summer season theme is pastel fairies.

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:06.800
Wearing dresses in light and adorable colors

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:09.090
makes it feel like you can actually fly!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.680
It's just as I thought about 
Yozora-senpai and Mahiru-chan!

00:24:13.680 --> 00:24:14.720
What do you mean?

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:17.260
Yep, there's a challenge on the horizon.

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:18.600
What's gonna happen?!

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:20.850
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:22.270
Mahiru's Challenge!

00:24:22.270 --> 00:24:24.400
Become the first-star idol!
